               END-PERFORM.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-COLOUR-0075.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
